Mai ochiru kareha no naka ni

00:22:58.282 --> 00:23:05.620
Kimi no sugata ga mieru made

00:23:05.756 --> 00:23:13.629
Same kaketa coffee cup

00:23:14.265 --> 00:23:22.195
Boku wa ryoute de atatameteru

00:23:22.373 --> 00:23:25.433
I 'm waiting for you, girl

00:23:25.576 --> 00:23:31.139
Umarete kara zutto
kono hi 0

00:23:31.315 --> 00:23:38.050
Matte ita kiga suru yo

00:23:38.255 --> 00:23:41.122
Just waiting for your love

00:23:41.258 --> 00:23:47.163
Jidai ni furi tsumoru
kimi e no

00:23:47.298 --> 00:23:54.568
Omoi ni umoretakute
